#: ../../source/disaggregated_prefill/nixl/xpyd.rst:152
msgid "The proxy server coordinates the multi-prefiller disaggregated workflow:"
msgstr "代理服务器协调多 prefiller 分离式工作流："

#: ../../source/disaggregated_prefill/nixl/xpyd.rst:154
msgid "**Request Handling**: Receives client requests on port 9000"
msgstr "**请求处理**：在端口 9000 接收客户端请求"

#: ../../source/disaggregated_prefill/nixl/xpyd.rst:155
msgid ""
"**Load Balancing**: Distributes requests across multiple prefillers using"
" round-robin"
msgstr "**负载均衡**：使用轮询方式在多个 prefiller 之间分配请求"

#: ../../source/disaggregated_prefill/nixl/xpyd.rst:156
msgid ""
"**Prefill Coordination**: Sends requests to prefillers with "
"``max_tokens=1``"
msgstr "**Prefill 协调**：使用 ``max_tokens=1`` 向 prefiller 发送请求"

#: ../../source/disaggregated_prefill/nixl/xpyd.rst:157
msgid "**Prefill Response**: Receives prefiller that says nixl transfer is done"
msgstr "**Prefill 响应**：接收 prefiller 指示 nixl 传输完成的响应"

#: ../../source/disaggregated_prefill/nixl/xpyd.rst:158
msgid "**Response Streaming**: Streams the full response from the decoder"
msgstr "**响应流式传输**：从 decoder 流式传输完整响应"

#: ../../source/disaggregated_prefill/nixl/xpyd.rst:159
msgid "**Performance Monitoring**: Tracks Time-To-First-Token (TTFT) statistics"
msgstr "**性能监控**：跟踪首个 Token 时间（TTFT）统计数据"

#: ../../source/disaggregated_prefill/nixl/xpyd.rst:161
msgid ""
"Key features: - **Round-robin distribution**: Balances load across "
"``--num-prefillers`` instances - **Fault tolerance**: Handles prefiller "
"failures gracefully - **Monitoring**: Provides detailed TTFT statistics "
"for each prefiller"
msgstr "关键特性：- **轮询分配**：在 ``--num-prefillers`` 个实例之间平衡负载 - **容错能力**：优雅地处理 prefiller 故障 - **监控**：为每个 prefiller 提供详细的 TTFT 统计数据"

#: ../../source/disaggregated_prefill/nixl/xpyd.rst:166
msgid "Supported endpoints: - ``/v1/completions`` - ``/v1/chat/completions``"
msgstr "支持的端点：- ``/v1/completions`` - ``/v1/chat/completions``"

